        "Content": "No. 1 Winward Drive,  Donegal Town  F94 EOA9\r\n\r\n\r\nExcellent  4 B/r (2 en-suite) Residence\r\n\r\n\r\nVery convenient setting on the Old Laghey Road, only 550 metres from Donegal Hospital and 1.25 km. from The Diamond – linked by footpath.\r\n\r\nConstructed in 2005 and extending to 158.13 sq.m. (1701 sq.ft.)\r\n\r\nGround Floor.\tLiving Room,  Kitchen with Dining Area, Utility & W.C.;\r\nFirst Floor.\t\t3 No. Bedrooms (1 en-suite) & Bathroom\r\nSecond Floor.\t1 No. Bedroom   (en-suite)\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nEntrance Hallway\t\t\r\n\r\nW.C.\t\t\t\tToilet and Wash Basin;  tiled floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room\t\t\t4.58 m.  x  3.57 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tsolid oak floor; solid fuel stove; overlooking front landscaped \t\t\t\tgarden,  double doors opening to -\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining\t\t6.95 m.  x  3.50 m.\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\tKitchen\ttiled floor;  fitted units with integrated fridge freezer,  stand \t\t\t\talone \tdishwasher\r\n\r\n\t\tDining\tSolid oak floor,  patio door to rear garden\r\n\r\n   \r\n\r\nUtility\t\t\t\tFitted units; plumbed for washing machine\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\t\t\tWalk-in Hot Press\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 1\t\t4.60 m.  x  3.48 m.   carpet\r\n\r\n\ten-suite\t\telectric shower, toilet and wash basin; tiled floor and lower \t\t\t\twalls\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\nBedroom No. 2\t\t3.50 m.  x  3.49 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tcarpet;  overlooking rear garden\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 3\t\t3.41 m.  x  2.29 m.   carpet\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.58 m.  x  2.14 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tBath with shower attachment overhead, toilet and wash basin;  \t\t\t\ttiled floor and lower walls\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSecond Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 4\t\t4.61 m.  x  3.57 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tcarpet;  2 velow windows\t\t\r\n\r\n\ten-suite\t\t3.32 m.  x  2.53 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tcorner jacuzzi bath with electric shower overhead, toilet and \t\t\t\twash basin;  tiled floor and 80% tiled walls\r\n\r\n\tWalk-in wardrobe\t3.58 m.  x  1.51 m.  carpet\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nStorage Room\t\t3.32 m.  x  1.51 m.\r\n\r\n\r\nPVC  Double Glazed Windows\t\tOil fired central heating\r\n\r\nBER -  B3\t\tBer No.  104869730\t\tLiving Area -  158.13 sq.m. (1701 sq.ft.)\r\n\r\nRed brick paved are to front with off street parking for 2 / 3 cars\r\n\r\nPrivate landscaped garden to front and rear\r\n\r\nComprised in Folio DL 61530F"
